    "findings": [
      "Load-complete reads the active instance attributefix.json and can write the minimum and maximum of RangedAttribute through accessors. Package carries no such config override.",
      "For unmodified generated defaults the five compiled upper-limit overrides are 1000000. Native caps for ATTACK_DAMAGE and ATTACK_KNOCKBACK in pinned source are 2048 and 5.",
      "KNOCKBACK_RESISTANCE is a separate attribute absent from the compiled override map. Its default maximum comes from existing native attribute (1 in the pinned source). Existing instance configuration can change it; no current running input used.",
      "Exact damage comparisons need the effective attribute inputs with target health and absorption. Explicit velocity writes remain separate from the native knockback attribute path."
    ]
  },
